1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,206
Snowball or avalanche? We ran both on the same $13,000 of debt.

2
00:00:05,626 --> 00:00:07,359
The difference was $42.

3
00:00:07,779 --> 00:00:10,558
Avalanche: $805 in interest.

4
00:00:10,978 --> 00:00:12,748
Snowball: $847.

5
00:00:13,168 --> 00:00:15,567
But the snowball wipes out your first debt in month two.

6
00:00:15,987 --> 00:00:17,900
The avalanche takes until month six.

7
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,718
So pick the one you won't quit.

8
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:22,292
The full breakdown is on my channel.

9
00:00:22,712 --> 00:00:25,118
Follow for more money math, with real numbers.
